22:12:44.289Z\\",\\n  \\"description\\": \\"Describe the requested design and content changes\\"\\n}\\n</script>\\n<script id=\\"guides-content\\" type=\\"application/json\\">\\n{\\n  \\"schemaVersion\\": 1,\\n  \\"exportType\\": \\"buildfire-guides-ai-release\\",\\n  \\"lessons\\": [\\n    {\\n      \\"schemaVersion\\": 1,\\n      \\"slug\\": \\"blw-o-que-e\\",\\n      \\"title\\": \\"¿Qué es el BLW?\\",\\n      \\"tag\\": \\"Fundamentos\\",\\n      \\"icon\\": \\"book\\",\\n      \\"readTime\\": \\"8 min\\",\\n      \\"phaseKeys\\": [\\n        \\"5\\"\\n      ],\\n      \\"listThemeKey\\": \\"tema-comecar\\",\\n      \\"listThemeLabel\\": \\"Comece por aqui\\",\\n      \\"listThemeSubtitle\\": \\"A base do BLW, do zero\\",\\n      \\"listThemeIcon\\": \\"leaf\\",\\n      \\"tldr\\": [\\n        \\"BLW = o bebê lidera a própria alimentação desde o início\\",\\n        \\"Começa aos 6 meses, junto com os sinais de prontidão\\",\\n        \\"Não existe um único jeito certo - cada bebê é único\\",\\n        \\"O leite materno/fórmula segue sendo o alimento principal até 1 ano\\",\\n        \\"O objetivo desta fase não é o bebê comer muito, mas explorar\\"\\n      ],\\n      \\"bodyHtml\\": \\"\\\\u003cp class=\\\\\\"bf-wysiwyg-top bf-wysiwyg-hide-app\\\\\\">\\\\u003cimg data-no-blob=\\\\\\"\\\\\\" data-id=\\\\\\"1750942630079\\\\\\" src=\\\\\\"data:image/png;base64,iVBORw0KGgoAAAANSUhEUgAAAAEAAAABAQMAAAAl21bKAAAAA1BMVEUAAACnej3aAAAAAXRSTlMAQObYZgAAAApJREFUCNdjYAAAAAIAAeIhvDMAAAAASUVORK5CYII=\\\\\\" style=\\\\\\"display: none;\\\\\\" data-type=\\\\\\"dynamic-expression\\\\\\" class=\\\\\\"\\\\\\">\\\\u003c/p>\\\\n\\\\u003cp class=\\\\\\"bf-wysiwyg-top bf-wysiwyg-hide-app\\\\\\">\\\\u003cstrong>\\\\u003ca href=\\\\\\"#que-es\\\\\\">1 • ¿Qué es el Baby-Led Weaning (BLW)?\\\\u003c/a>\\\\u003c/strong>\\\\u003c/p>\\\\n\\\\u003cp class=\\\\\\"bf-wysiwyg-top bf-wysiwyg-hide-app\\\\\\">\\\\u003cstrong>\\\\u003ca href=\\\\\\"#como-funciona\\\\\\">2 • ¿Cómo funciona el BLW?\\\\u003c/a>\\\\u003c/strong>\\\\u003c/p>\\\\n\\\\u003cp class=\\\\\\"bf-wysiwyg-top bf-wysiwyg-hide-app\\\\\\">\\\\u003cstrong>\\\\u003ca href=\\\\\\"#ventajas\\\\\\">3 • Ventajas y desventajas del BLW\\\\u003c/a>\\\\u003c/strong>\\\\u003c/p>\\\\n\\\\u003chr class=\\\\\\"bf-wysiwyg-top bf-wysiwyg-hide-app\\\\\\">\\\\n\\\\u003cp id=\\\\\\"que-es\\\\\\" class=\\\\\\"bf-wysiwyg-top bf-wysiwyg-hide-app\\\\\\">BLW son las siglas de \\\\u003cstrong>Baby-Led Weaning\\\\u003c/strong>, que significa literalmente “alimentación complementaria guiada por el bebé”, y que es, básicamente, una introducción paulatina de los sólidos autorregulada por tu peque.\\\\u003c/p>\\\\n\\\\u003cblockquote class=\\\\\\"bf-wysiwyg-top bf-wysiwyg-hide-app\\\\\\">\\\\n\\\\u003cp class=\\\\\\"\\\\\\">Con este método, los bebés tienen la oportunidad de comer solos desde el principio.\\\\u003c/p>\\\\n\\\\u003c/blockquote>\\\\n\\\\u003cp class=\\\\\\"bf-wysiwyg-top bf-wysiwyg-hide-app\\\\\\">\\\\u003cspan style=\\\\\\"font-weight: 400;\\\\\\">El método BLW, también conocido como método Rapley\\\\u003c/span>\\\\u003csup>\\\\u003cspan style=\\\\\\"font-weight: 400;\\\\\\">1\\\\u003c/span>\\\\u003c/sup>\\\\u003cspan style=\\\\\\"font-weight: 400;\\\\\\">, se basa en la idea de que los bebés son capaces de alimentarse por sí mismos cuando están preparados desde el punto de vista del desarrollo. Este enfoque hace hincapié en ofrecer alimentos sólidos en forma de trozos blandos y manejables que el bebé puede agarrar cuando ya está lo suficientemente desarrollado para ello.\\\\u003c/span>\\\\u003c/p>\\\\n\\\\u003cp class=\\\\\\"bf-wysiwyg-top bf-wysiwyg-hide-app\\\\\\">La fase de la alimentación complementaria es la que va desde los 6 meses hasta los 2 años de edad.\\\\u003csup>1\\\\u003c/sup>\\\\u003c/p>\\\\n\\\\u003cp class=\\\\\\"bf-wysiwyg-top bf-wysiwyg-hide-app\\\\\\">La introducción de los alimentos sólidos es el momento en que el bebé deja de alimentarse exclusivamente de la leche materna o de fórmula y pasa a tener contacto con otros alimentos, texturas y distintos tamaños de raciones.\\\\u003c/p>\\\\n\\\\u003cp class=\\\\\\"bf-wysiwyg-top bf-wysiwyg-hide-app\\\\\\">\\\\u003cimg src=\\\\\\"https://buildfire.imgix.net/dcbca80b-3d23-11ea-91c9-06e43182e96c/cc37f110-528d-11f0-8879-812a2ef26214.png?width=1440&amp;height=1440\\\\\\" alt=\\\\\\"\\\\\\" expr-src=\\\\\\"${buildfire.imageLib.resizeImage(\'https://s3-us-west-2.amazonaws.com/imageserver.prod/dcbca80b-3d23-11ea-91c9-06e43182e96c/cc37f110-528d-11f0-8879-812a2ef26214.png\', { size: \'full_width\', aspect: \'1:1\' })}\\\\\\" class=\\\\\\"full_width\\\\\\" data-bf-image=\\\\\\"%7B%22resize%22%3Atrue%2C%22crop%22%3A%22%22%2C%22fixed%22%3A%22%22%2C%22responsive%22%3A%22full_width%22%2C%22originalSrc%22%3A%22https%3A//s3-us-west-2.amazonaws.com/imageserver.prod/dcbca80b-3d23-11ea-91c9-06e43182e96c/cc37f110-528d-11f0-8879-812a2ef26214.png%22%7D\\\\\\" data-execute=\\\\\\"%7B%22action%22%3A%22linkToApp%22%2C%22instanceId%22%3A%2203dd5856-99ed-4950-ad40-6d95a29ef7f2-1562922805116%22%2C%22title%22%3A%22Lactancia%20y%20alimentaci%F3n%20complementaria%22%2C%22iconUrl%22%3A%22https%3A//s3-us-west-2.amazonaws.com/imageserver.prod/dcbca80b-3d23-11ea-91c9-06e43182e96c/lactancia-home.jpg%22%2C%22iconClassName%22%3Anull%2C%22queryString%22%3Anull%2C%22deeplinkId%22%3Anull%7D\\\\\\">\\\\u003c/p>\\\\n\\\\u003cp class=\\\\\\"bf-wysiwyg-top bf-wysiwyg-hide-app\\\\\\">En lugar de \\\\\\"destete\\\\\\", hablamos de \\\\u003cstrong>alimentación complementaria\\\\u003c/strong> porque introducimos alimentos cuyos nutrientes complementan el consumo de leche materna o de fórmula.\\\\u003c/p>\\\\n\\\\u003cp class=\\\\\\"bf-wysiwyg-top bf-wysiwyg-hide-app\\\\\\">\\\\u003cimg src=\\\\\\"https://buildfire.imgix.net/dcbca80b-3d23-11ea-91c9-06e43182e96c/1844ef90-528e-11f0-bab1-771a8c68699e.png?width=1440&amp;height=1440\\\\\\" alt=\\\\\\"\\\\\\" expr-src=\\\\\\"${buildfire.imageLib.resizeImage(\'https://s3-us-west-2.amazonaws.com/imageserver.prod/dcbca80b-3d23-11ea-91c9-06e43182e96c/1844ef90-528e-11f0-bab1-771a8c68699e.png\', { size: \'full_width\', aspect: \'1:1\' })}\\\\\\" class=\\\\\\"full_width\\\\\\" data-bf-image=\\\\\\"%7B%22resize%22%3Atrue%2C%22crop%22%3A%22%22%2C%22fixed%22%3A%22%22%2C%22responsive%22%3A%22full_width%22%2C%22originalSrc%22%3A%22https%3A//s3-us-west-2.amazonaws.com/imageserver.prod/dcbca80b-3d23-11ea-91c9-06e43182e96c/1844ef90-528e-11f0-bab1-771a8c68699e.png%22%7D\\\\\\">\\\\u003cstrong>Hasta los 6 meses, la leche es el único alimento que precisa un bebé para crecer y desarrollarse.\\\\u003c/strong>\\\\u003c/p>\\\\n\\\\u003cp class=\\\\\\"bf-wysiwyg-top bf-wysiwyg-hide-app\\\\\\">Pasados los 6 meses, los bebés empiezan a tener más necesidad de energía y nutrientes. Aun así, hasta cumplir 1 año, la leche sigue siendo su alimento principal.&nbsp;\\\\u003c/p>\\\\n\\\\u003cp class=\\\\\\"bf-wysiwyg-top bf-wysiwyg-hide-app\\\\\\">En la fase de \\\\u003cstrong>1 a 2 años\\\\u003c/strong>, el consumo de otros alimentos aumenta, y \\\\u003cstrong>la leche&nbsp;pasa a complementar la alimentación sólida\\\\u003c/strong>. Pero ojo, sigue siendo una parte importante de su alimentación y de su vida.\\\\u003c/p>\\\\n\\\\u003cp class=\\\\\\"bf-wysiwyg-top bf-wysiwyg-hide-app\\\\\\">\\\\u003cimg src=\\\\\\"https://buildfire.imgix.net/dcbca80b-3d23-11ea-91c9-06e43182e96c/nutricion-inicios.png?width=1440&amp;height=1440\\\\\\" alt=\\\\\\"\\\\\\" expr-src=\\\\\\"${buildfire.imageLib.resizeImage(\'https://s3-us-west-2.amazonaws.com/imageserver.prod/dcbca80b-3d23-11ea-91c9-06e43182e96c/nutricion-inicios.png\', { size: \'full_width\', aspect: \'1:1\' })}\\\\\\" class=\\\\\\"full_width\\\\\\" data-bf-image=\\\\\\"%7B%22resize%22%3Atrue%2C%22crop%22%3A%22%22%2C%22fixed%22%3A%22%22%2C%22responsive%22%3A%22full_width%22%2C%22originalSrc%22%3A%22https%3A//s3-us-west-2.amazonaws.com/imageserver.prod/dcbca80b-3d23-11ea-91c9-06e43182e96c/nutricion-inicios.png%22%7D\\\\\\">Pero lo que vas a aprender aquí no se limita a los 2 años. Se trata de un aprendizaje positivo para toda la vida.\\\\u003c/p>\\\\n\\\\u003cblockquote class=\\\\\\"bf-wysiwyg-top bf-wysiwyg-hide-app\\\\\\">\\\\n\\\\u003cp>El BLW ayuda al bebé a desarrollar habilidades motoras mientras se alimenta solo. Anima al bebé a utilizar todos sus sentidos y esto es muy beneficioso para su desarrollo.\\\\u003csup>2\\\\u003c/sup>\\\\u003c/p>\\\\n\\\\u003c/blockquote>\\\\n\\\\u003cp class=\\\\\\"bf-wysiwyg-top bf-wysiwyg-hide-app\\\\\\">\\\\u003cstrong>Otros beneficios del BLW para el bebé:\\\\u003csup>3\\\\u003c/sup>&nbsp;\\\\u003c/strong>\\\\u003c/p>\\\\n\\\\u003cp dir=\\\\\\"ltr\\\\\\" class=\\\\\\"bf-wysiwyg-top bf-wysiwyg-hide-app\\\\\\">•&nbsp;Oportunidad de \\\\u003cstrong>experimentar&nbsp;una gran variedad de sabores y texturas\\\\u003c/strong>.\\\\u003c/p>\\\\n\\\\u003cp dir=\\\\\\"ltr\\\\\\" class=\\\\\\"bf-wysiwyg-top bf-wysiwyg-hide-app\\\\\\">•&nbsp;Desarrollar \\\\u003cstrong>buenos hábitos alimentarios\\\\u003c/strong>.\\\\u003c/p>\\\\n\\\\u003cp dir=\\\\\\"ltr\\\\\\" class=\\\\\\"bf-wysiwyg-top bf-wysiwyg-hide-app\\\\\\">•&nbsp;Gestionar&nbsp;la \\\\u003cstrong>selectividad alimentaria\\\\u003c/strong>.\\\\u003c/p>\\\\n\\\\u003cp dir=\\\\\\"ltr\\\\\\" class=\\\\\\"bf-wysiwyg-top bf-wysiwyg-hide-app\\\\\\">•&nbsp;Aprender a comer y familiarizarse gradualmente con los \\\\u003cstrong>aspectos sociales y educativos de las comidas\\\\u003c/strong> familiares.\\\\u003c/p>\\\\n\\\\u003cp dir=\\\\\\"ltr\\\\\\" class=\\\\\\"bf-wysiwyg-top bf-wysiwyg-hide-app\\\\\\">\\\\u003cimg src=\\\\\\"https://buildfire.imgix.net/dcbca80b-3d23-11ea-91c9-06e43182e96c/beneficios%20del%20blw1.png?width=1440&amp;height=1440\\\\\\" alt=\\\\\\"\\\\\\" expr-src=\\\\\\"${buildfire.imageLib.resizeImage(\'https://s3-us-west-2.amazonaws.com/imageserver.prod/dcbca80b-3d23-11ea-91c9-06e43182e96c/beneficios%20del%20blw1.png\', { size: \'full_width\', aspect: \'1:1\' })}\\\\\\" class=\\\\\\"full_width\\\\\\" data-bf-image=\\\\\\"%7B%22resize%22%3Atrue%2C%22crop%22%3A%22%22%2C%22fixed%22%3A%22%22%2C%22responsive%22%3A%22full_width%22%2C%22originalSrc%22%3A%22https%3A//s3-us-west-2.amazonaws.com/imageserver.prod/dcbca80b-3d23-11ea-91c9-06e43182e96c/beneficios%2520del%2520blw1.png%22%7D\\\\\\">\\\\u003cimg src=\\\\\\"https://buildfire.imgix.net/dcbca80b-3d23-11ea-91c9-06e43182e96c/beneficios%20del%20blw2.png?width=1440&amp;height=1440\\\\\\" alt=\\\\\\"\\\\\\" expr-src=\\\\\\"${buildfire.imageLib.resizeImage(\'https://s3-us-west-2.amazonaws.com/imageserver.prod/dcbca80b-3d23-11ea-91c9-06e43182e96c/beneficios%20del%20blw2.png\', { size: \'full_width\', aspect: \'1:1\' })}\\\\\\" class=\\\\\\"full_width\\\\\\" data-bf-image=\\\\\\"%7B%22resize%22%3Atrue%2C%22crop%22%3A%22%22%2C%22fixed%22%3A%22%22%2C%22responsive%22%3A%22full_width%22%2C%22originalSrc%22%3A%22https%3A//s3-us-west-2.amazonaws.com/imageserver.prod/dcbca80b-3d23-11ea-91c9-06e43182e96c/beneficios%2520del%2520blw2.png%22%7D\\\\\\">\\\\u003c/p>\\\\n\\\\u003cp class=\\\\\\"bf-wysiwyg-top bf-wysiwyg-hide-app\\\\\\">\\\\u003ciframe width=\\\\\\"560\\\\\\" height=\\\\\\"315\\\\\\" title=\\\\\\"YouTube video player\\\\\\" src=\\\\\\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/LTu11jdORNA\\\\\\" frameborder=\\\\\\"0\\\\\\" allowfullscreen=\\\\\\"allowfullscreen\\\\\\">\\\\u003c/iframe>\\\\u003c/p>\\\\n\\\\u003cp class=\\\\\\"bf-wysiwyg-top bf-wysiwyg-hide-app\\\\\\" dir=\\\\\\"ltr\\\\\\">\\\\u003cstrong>\\\\u003cspan style=\\\\\\"font-size: 18px;\\\\\\">\\\\u003cbr>Los bebés siguen nuestro ejemplo\\\\u003c/span>\\\\u003c/strong>\\\\u003c/p>\\\\n\\\\u003cp class=\\\\\\"bf-wysiwyg-top bf-wysiwyg-hide-app\\\\\\" dir=\\\\\\"ltr\\\\\\">Es importante recordar que \\\\u003cstrong>nuestros hijos son un reflejo de nosotros mismos\\\\u003c/strong>.\\\\u003c/p>\\\\n\\\\u003cp class=\\\\\\"bf-wysiwyg-top bf-wysiwyg-hide-app\\\\\\" dir=\\\\\\"ltr\\\\\\">Si no hacemos un esfuerzo&nbsp;por consumir alimentos sanos y variados, será muy difícil transmitirles esta idea.\\\\u003c/p>\\\\n\\\\u003cp class=\\\\\\"bf-wysiwyg-top bf-wysiwyg-hide-app\\\\\\" dir=\\\\\\"ltr\\\\\\">\\\\u003cstrong>Durante las comidas familiares, tu bebé aprenderá mucho de tus actitudes, tú serás su modelo a seguir, te verán comer e imitarán lo que tú hagas, y por eso es muy importante que les des buen ejemplo.\\\\u003csup>4\\\\u003c/sup>\\\\u003c/strong>\\\\u003c/p>\\\\n\\\\u003cp class=\\\\\\"bf-wysiwyg-top bf-wysiwyg-hide-app\\\\\\" dir=\\\\\\"ltr\\\\\\">La importancia de una alimentación buena y nutritiva para bebés y niños es incuestionable. La calidad de los alimentos que les ofrecemos desde pequeños tiene un impacto en sus patrones de alimentación en el futuro, en la infancia y en la vida adulta.\\\\u003c/p>\\\\n\\\\u003cp class=\\\\\\"bf-wysiwyg-top bf-wysiwyg-hide-app\\\\\\" dir=\\\\\\"ltr\\\\\\">\\\\u003cspan style=\\\\\\"color: #000000;\\\\\\">En otras palabras, \\\\u003cstrong>crear buenos hábitos alimenticios es la base de una buena salud de por vida\\\\u003c/strong> y ayuda a prevenir la aparición de enfermedades como la diabetes, la hipertensión, la obesidad y el cáncer.\\\\u003c/span>\\\\u003c/p>\\\\n\\\\u003cp class=\\\\\\"bf-wysiwyg-top bf-wysiwyg-hide-app\\\\\\" dir=\\\\\\"ltr\\\\\\">\\\\u003cspan style=\\\\\\"font-size: 18px;\\\\\\">\\\\u003cstrong>\\\\u003cspan style=\\\\\\"color: #000000;\\\\\\">\\\\u003cbr>Cada bebé es único\\\\u003c/span>\\\\u003c/strong>\\\\u003c/span>\\\\u003c/p>\\\\n\\\\u003cp class=\\\\\\"bf-wysiwyg-top bf-wysiwyg-hide-app\\\\\\" dir=\\\\\\"ltr\\\\\\">Es importante saber que cada&nbsp;bebé&nbsp;es diferente y tiene su propio ritmo. Nunca compares a tu hijo con otro niño.\\\\u003c/p>\\\\n\\\\u003cblockquote class=\\\\\\"bf-wysiwyg-top bf-wysiwyg-hide-app\\\\\\">\\\\n\\\\u003cp dir=\\\\\\"ltr\\\\\\">Cada bebé es único y tiene sus preferencias, apetito y curva de crecimiento. Respeta el ritmo de tu bebé y todo irá bien.&nbsp;\\\\u003c/p>\\\\n\\\\u003c/blockquote>\\\\n\\\\u003cp class=\\\\\\"bf-wysiwyg-top bf-wysiwyg-hide-app\\\\\\" dir=\\\\\\"ltr\\\\\\">\\\\u003cspan id=\\\\\\"docs-internal-guid-d0a9b2a0-7fff-aab4-7f08-fdb5d13601dc\\\\\\">Esto se aplica a la velocidad a la que participan en el proceso de introducción de alimentos y al tamaño de la porción de alimentos que van a consumir. \\\\u003c/span>\\\\u003c/p>\\\\n\\\\u003cp class=\\\\\\"bf-wysiwyg-top bf-wysiwyg-hide-app\\\\\\" dir=\\\\\\"ltr\\\\\\">\\\\u003cspan id=\\\\\\"docs-internal-guid-d0a9b2a0-7fff-aab4-7f08-fdb5d13601dc\\\\\\">\\\\u003cstrong>Mientras esté creciendo y desarrollándose dentro de su curva de crecimiento, no hay razón para preocuparse si come poco o si come demasiado.\\\\u003c/strong>\\\\u003c/span>\\\\u003c/p>\\\\n\\\\u003cp class=\\\\\\"bf-wysiwyg-top bf-wysiwyg-hide-app\\\\\\" dir=\\\\\\"ltr\\\\\\">\\\\u003cimg src=\\\\\\"https://buildfire.imgix.net/dcbca80b-3d23-11ea-91c9-06e43182e96c/6-min.png?width=1188&amp;height=1188\\\\\\" width=\\\\\\"\\\\\\">\\\\u003c/p>\\\\n\\\\u003cp class=\\\\\\"bf-wysiwyg-top bf-wysiwyg-hide-app\\\\\\" dir=\\\\\\"ltr\\\\\\">\\\\u003ca href=\\\\\\"#top\\\\\\">\\\\u003cimg src=\\\\\\"https://buildfire.imgix.net/dcbca80b-3d23-11ea-91c9-06e43182e96c/volver-arriba-grande.png?width=1080&amp;height=1080\\\\\\" alt=\\\\\\"\\\\\\" data-bf-image=\\\\\\"%7B%22resize%22%3Atrue%2C%22crop%22%3A%22%22%2C%22fixed%22%3A%22%22%2C%22responsive%22%3A%22full_width%22%2C%22originalSrc%22%3A%22https%3A//s3-us-west-2.amazonaws.com/imageserver.prod/dcbca80b-3d23-11ea-91c9-06e43182e96c/volver-arriba-grande.png%22%7D\\\\\\">\\\\u003c/a>\\\\u003c/p>\\\\n\\\\u003chr class=\\\\\\"bf-wysiwyg-top bf-wysiwyg-hide-app\\\\\\">\\\\n\\\\u003cp id=\\\\\\"como-funciona\\\\\\" class=\\\\\\"bf-wysiwyg-top bf-wysiwyg-hide-app\\\\\\" dir=\\\\\\"ltr\\\\\\" style=\\\\\\"line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 9pt; margin-bottom: 9pt; text-align: left;\\\\\\">\\\\u003cimg src=\\\\\\"https://buildfire.imgix.net/dcbca80b-3d23-11ea-91c9-06e43182e96c/44135340-5294-11f0-ab2a-cf65c95ce151.png?width=1440&amp;height=1440\\\\\\" alt=\\\\\\"\\\\\\" expr-src=\\\\\\"${buildfire.imageLib.resizeImage(\'https://s3-us-west-2.amazonaws.com/imageserver.prod/dcbca80b-3d23-11ea-91c9-06e43182e96c/44135340-5294-11f0-ab2a-cf65c95ce151.png\', { size: \'full_width\', aspect: \'1:1\' })}\\\\\\" class=\\\\\\"full_width\\\\\\" data-bf-image=\\\\\\"%7B%22resize%22%3Atrue%2C%22crop%22%3A%22%22%2C%22fixed%22%3A%22%22%2C%22responsive%22%3A%22full_width%22%2C%22originalSrc%22%3A%22https%3A//s3-us-west-2.amazonaws.com/imageserver.prod/dcbca80b-3d23-11ea-91c9-06e43182e96c/44135340-5294-11f0-ab2a-cf65c95ce151.png%22%7D\\\\\\">\\\\u003c/p>\\\\n\\\\u003cp dir=\\\\\\"ltr\\\\\\" class=\\\\\\"bf-wysiwyg-top bf-wysiwyg-hide-app\\\\\\">Hay varias cosas que conviene saber antes de empezar a hacer BLW:\\\\u003c/p>\\\\n\\\\u003cp class=\\\\\\"bf-wysiwyg-top bf-wysiwyg-hide-app\\\\\\" dir=\\\\\\"ltr\\\\\\" style=\\\\\\"line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 9pt; margin-bottom: 9pt; text-align: left;\\\\\\">\\\\u003cspan style=\\\\\\"color: #000000; font-size: 16px;\\\\\\">\\\\u003cspan style=\\\\\\"font-family: Arial; background-color: transparent; font-weight: bold; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\\\\\\">El bebé se alimenta solo\\\\u003c/span> \\\\u003c/span>\\\\u003c/p>\\\\n\\\\u003cp dir=\\\\\\"ltr\\\\\\" class=\\\\\\"bf-wysiwyg-top bf-wysiwyg-hide-app\\\\\\">Ya sea con la cuchara o con los alimentos en trozos, es el bebé quien regula su propio proceso de aprendizaje para comer.\\\\u003c/p>\\\\n\\\\u003cp dir=\\\\\\"ltr\\\\\\" class=\\\\\\"bf-wysiwyg-top bf-wysiwyg-hide-app\\\\\\">Eso implica que tienes que dejarle que se incline él mismo para alcanzar la comida, y no meterle la cuchara en la boca sin que se entere.\\\\u003c/p>\\\\n\\\\u003cp dir=\\\\\\"ltr\\\\\\" class=\\\\\\"bf-wysiwyg-top bf-wysiwyg-hide-app\\\\\\">Aun así, el bebé nunca puede comer solo sin vigilancia. La supervisión de un adulto es imprescindible, y el papel del cuidador es estar presente para orientar y vigilar.\\\\u003c/p>\\\\n\\\\u003cp class=\\\\\\"bf-wysiwyg-top bf-wysiwyg-hide-app\\\\\\" dir=\\\\\\"ltr\\\\\\" style=\\\\\\"line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 9pt; margin-bottom: 9pt; text-align: left;\\\\\\">\\\\u003cspan style=\\\\\\"color: #000000; font-size: 16px;\\\\\\">\\\\u003cspan style=\\\\\\"font-family: Arial; background-color: transparent; font-weight: bold; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\\\\\\">Comerá a la vez que&nbsp;la familia\\\\u003c/span>\\\\u003cspan style=\\\\\\"font-family: Arial; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\\\\\\">\\\\u003cstrong> (o de quien lo acompañe)\\\\u003c/strong> \\\\u003c/span>\\\\u003c/span>\\\\u003c/p>\\\\n\\\\u003cp class=\\\\\\"bf-wysiwyg-top bf-wysiwyg-hide-app\\\\\\">Nuestros hijos probablemente serán un reflejo de nuestra propia relación con la comida y la alimentación.\\\\u003c/p>\\\\n\\\\u003cp class=\\\\\\"bf-wysiwyg-top bf-wysiwyg-hide-app\\\\\\">Si nosotros no comemos alimentos nutritivos variados, será muy difícil inculcarles este hábito.\\\\u003c/p>\\\\n\\\\u003cp class=\\\\\\"bf-wysiwyg-top bf-wysiwyg-hide-app\\\\\\">Es importante que comáis todos juntos, porque así el bebé aprovecha la compañía mutua para socializar y aprender.\\\\u003c/p>\\\\n\\\\u003cp class=\\\\\\"bf-wysiwyg-top bf-wysiwyg-hide-app\\\\\\">Durante las comidas familiares, tu bebé aprenderá de ti porque eres su modelo a seguir. Te observará mientras comes y querrá imitarte. Dar ejemplo es fundamental.\\\\u003c/p>\\\\n\\\\u003cp class=\\\\\\"bf-wysiwyg-top bf-wysiwyg-hide-app\\\\\\">No le des de comer al bebé y luego comas tú: la comida es colaboración e intercambio.\\\\u003c/p>\\\\n\\\\u003cp class=\\\\\\"bf-wysiwyg-top bf-wysiwyg-hide-app\\\\\\" dir=\\\\\\"ltr\\\\\\" style=\\\\\\"line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 9pt; margin-bottom: 9pt; text-align: left;\\\\\\">\\\\u003cspan style=\\\\\\"color: #000000; font-size: 16px;\\\\\\">\\\\u003cspan style=\\\\\\"font-family: Arial; background-color: transparent; font-weight: bold; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\\\\\\">Le sirves la comida de forma adecuada y segura\\\\u003c/span>\\\\u003c/span>\\\\u003c/p>\\\\n\\\\u003cp dir=\\\\\\"ltr\\\\\\" class=\\\\\\"bf-wysiwyg-top bf-wysiwyg-hide-app\\\\\\">Tendrás que preparar el alimento de tal forma que él logre agarrarlo y llevárselo a la boca.\\\\u003c/p>\\\\n\\\\u003cp dir=\\\\\\"ltr\\\\\\" class=\\\\\\"bf-wysiwyg-top bf-wysiwyg-hide-app\\\\\\">Los cortes y formatos variarán en función de las habilidades motoras compatibles con la edad del bebé.\\\\u003c/p>\\\\n\\\\u003cp dir=\\\\\\"ltr\\\\\\" class=\\\\\\"bf-wysiwyg-top bf-wysiwyg-hide-app\\\\\\">Lo ideal es empezar con alimentos en forma de bastoncitos o tiras largas. Con ese formato, un bebé de 6 meses puede agarrar el alimento fácilmente, gestionarlo en la boca y masticarlo con las encías o los dientes.\\\\u003c/p>\\\\n\\\\u003cp dir=\\\\\\"ltr\\\\\\" class=\\\\\\"bf-wysiwyg-top bf-wysiwyg-hide-app\\\\\\">Los cortes varían a medida que el bebé va desarrollando la motricidad fina.\\\\u003c/p>\\\\n\\\\u003cp class=\\\\\\"bf-wysiwyg-top bf-wysiwyg-hide-app\\\\\\">\\\\u003cstrong>¿Por qué con el BLW ofrecemos trozos grandes al inicio de la alimentación complementaria?\\\\u003c/strong>\\\\u003c/p>\\\\n\\\\u003cp class=\\\\\\"bf-wysiwyg-top bf-wysiwyg-hide-app\\\\\\">\\\\u003cstrong>\\\\u003cimg src=\\\\\\"https://buildfire.imgix.net/dcbca80b-3d23-11ea-91c9-06e43182e96c/guia_trozos.png?width=1309&amp;height=1309\\\\\\" alt=\\\\\\"\\\\\\" data-bf-image=\\\\\\"%7B%22resize%22%3Atrue%2C%22crop%22%3A%22%22%2C%22fixed%22%3A%22%22%2C%22responsive%22%3A%22full_width%22%2C%22originalSrc%22%3A%22https%3A//s3-us-west-2.amazonaws.com/imageserver.prod/dcbca80b-3d23-11ea-91c9-06e43182e96c/guia_trozos.png%22%7D\\\\\\">&nbsp;\\\\u003c/strong>\\\\u003cstrong>1. Promueve la autonomía\\\\u003c/strong>\\\\u003c/p>\\\\n\\\\u003cp class=\\\\\\"bf-wysiwyg-top bf-wysiwyg-hide-app\\\\\\">Cuando ofrecemos a los bebés trozos grandes de comida, pueden agarrarlos, llevárselos a la boca y explorar la textura y el sabor de los alimentos, lo que ayuda a desarrollar la coordinación boca-mano-ojo.\\\\u003c/p>\\\\n\\\\u003cp class=\\\\\\"bf-wysiwyg-top bf-wysiwyg-hide-app\\\\\\">Es una estrategia estupenda para estimular el desarrollo saludable de tu bebé mientras exploran los alimentos.\\\\u003cbr>\\\\u003cbr>\\\\u003c/p>\\\\n\\\\u003cp class=\\\\\\"bf-wysiwyg-top bf-wysiwyg-hide-app\\\\\\">\\\\u003cimg src=\\\\\\"https://buildfire.imgix.net/dcbca80b-3d23-11ea-91c9-06e43182e96c/beneficios_trozos%20grandes.png?width=1309&amp;height=1309\\\\\\" alt=\\\\\\"\\\\\\" data-bf-image=\\\\\\"%7B%22resize%22%3Atrue%2C%22crop%22%3A%22%22%2C%22fixed%22%3A%22%22%2C%22responsive%22%3A%22full_width%22%2C%22originalSrc%22%3A%22https%3A//s3-us-west-2.amazonaws.com/imageserver.prod/dcbca80b-3d23-11ea-91c9-06e43182e96c/beneficios_trozos%2520grandes.png%22%7D\\\\\\">&nbsp;\\\\u003cbr>\\\\u003cstrong>2. Estimula el desarrollo de las habilidades de masticación\\\\u003c/strong>\\\\u003c/p>\\\\n\\\\u003cp class=\\\\\\"bf-wysiwyg-top bf-wysiwyg-hide-app\\\\\\">Ofrecer trozos grandes de comida incentiva además el uso de los músculos necesarios para \\\\u003cstrong>masticar\\\\u003c/strong>.\\\\u003c/p>\\\\n\\\\u003cp class=\\\\\\"bf-wysiwyg-top bf-wysiwyg-hide-app\\\\\\">Y esos músculos no sirven solo para masticar: también incentiva el \\\\u003cstrong>desarrollo de las habilidades motoras orales\\\\u003c/strong>, clave para el habla y el lenguaje.\\\\u003c/p>\\\\n\\\\u003cp class=\\\\\\"bf-wysiwyg-top bf-wysiwyg-hide-app\\\\\\">\\\\u003cstrong>3. Son más fáciles de gestionar\\\\u003cbr>\\\\u003c/strong>\\\\u003c/p>\\\\n\\\\u003cp class=\\\\\\"bf-wysiwyg-top bf-wysiwyg-hide-app\\\\\\">Los trozos grandes no le cabrán enteros en la boca, y así el bebé puede ir explorando el alimento y controlando el ritmo de ingesta de comida.&nbsp;\\\\u003c/p>\\\\n\\\\u003cp class=\\\\\\"bf-wysiwyg-top bf-wysiwyg-hide-app\\\\\\">El riesgo de atragantamiento viene determinado por varios factores del alimento, como el tamaño, el formato o la textura, además del nivel de desarrollo del bebé.\\\\u003c/p>\\\\n\\\\u003cp class=\\\\\\"bf-wysiwyg-top bf-wysiwyg-hide-app\\\\\\">\\\\u003cimg src=\\\\\\"https://buildfire.imgix.net/dcbca80b-3d23-11ea-91c9-06e43182e96c/reflejo%20arcada.png?width=1440&amp;height=1440\\\\\\" alt=\\\\\\"\\\\\\" expr-src=\\\\\\"${buildfire.imageLib.resizeImage(\'https://s3-us-west-2.amazonaws.com/imageserver.prod/dcbca80b-3d23-11ea-91c9-06e43182e96c/reflejo%20arcada.png\', { size: \'full_width\', aspect: \'1:1\' })}\\\\\\" class=\\\\\\"full_width\\\\\\" data-bf-image=\\\\\\"%7B%22resize%22%3Atrue%2C%22crop%22%3A%22%22%2C%22fixed%22%3A%22%22%2C%22responsive%22%3A%22full_width%22%2C%22originalSrc%22%3A%22https%3A//s3-us-west-2.amazonaws.com/imageserver.prod/dcbca80b-3d23-11ea-91c9-06e43182e96c/reflejo%2520arcada.png%22%7D\\\\\\">Recuerda que, para garantizar esta seguridad, el BLW debe empezarse cuando el bebé esté preparado&nbsp; \\\\u003cstrong>\\\\u003ca data-action-item=\\\\\\"%7B%22action%22%3A%22linkToApp%22%2C%22instanceId%22%3A%2203dd5856-99ed-4950-ad40-6d95a29ef7f2-1562922749297%22%2C%22title%22%3A%22Cu%E1ndo%20empezar%22%2C%22iconUrl%22%3A%22https%3A//s3-us-west-2.amazonaws.com/imageserver.prod/dcbca80b-3d23-11ea-91c9-06e43182e96c/cuando-empezar-home.jpg%22%2C%22iconClassName%22%3Anull%2C%22queryString%22%3Anull%2C%22deeplinkId%22%3Anull%7D\\\\\\">(cuando cumpla los 6 requisitos)\\\\u003c/a>\\\\u003c/strong> y siempre bajo la supervisión de un adulto.\\\\u003c/p>\\\\n\\\\u003cp class=\\\\\\"bf-wysiwyg-top bf-wysiwyg-hide-app\\\\\\">\\\\u003cstrong>\\\\u003cimg src=\\\\\\"https://buildfire.imgix.net/dcbca80b-3d23-11ea-91c9-06e43182e96c/motivo-seguridad.png?width=1440&amp;height=1440\\\\\\" alt=\\\\\\"\\\\\\" expr-src=\\\\\\"${buildfire.imageLib.resizeImage(\'https://s3-us-west-2.amazonaws.com/imageserver.prod/dcbca80b-3d23-11ea-91c9-06e43182e96c/motivo-seguridad.png\', { size: \'full_width\', aspect: \'1:1\' })}\\\\\\" class=\\\\\\"full_width\\\\\\" data-bf-image=\\\\\\"%7B%22resize%22%3Atrue%2C%22crop%22%3A%22%22%2C%22fixed%22%3A%22%22%2C%22responsive%22%3A%22full_width%22%2C%22originalSrc%22%3A%22https%3A//s3-us-west-2.amazonaws.com/imageserver.prod/dcbca80b-3d23-11ea-91c9-06e43182e96c/motivo-seguridad.png%22%7D\\\\\\">\\\\u003c/strong>\\\\u003cspan style=\\\\\\"color: #000000; font-size: 16px;\\\\\\">\\\\u003cspan style=\\\\\\"font-family: Arial; background-color: transparent; font-weight: bold; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\\\\\\">Se le presentarán todos los grupos de alimentos desde el comienzo\\\\u003c/span>\\\\u003c/span>\\\\u003c/p>\\\\n\\\\u003cp dir=\\\\\\"ltr\\\\\\" class=\\\\\\"bf-wysiwyg-top bf-wysiwyg-hide-app\\\\\\">Permitirás que coma de todo, excepto alimentos poco sanos o que no sean seguros para él (algunos alimentos no son recomendables hasta el año o más).\\\\u003c/p>\\\\n\\\\u003cp class=\\\\\\"bf-wysiwyg-top bf-wysiwyg-hide-app\\\\\\" dir=\\\\\\"ltr\\\\\\" style=\\\\\\"line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 9pt; margin-bottom: 9pt; text-align: left;\\\\\\">\\\\u003cspan style=\\\\\\"color: #000000; font-size: 16px;\\\\\\">\\\\u003cspan style=\\\\\\"font-family: Arial; background-color: transparent; font-weight: bold; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\\\\\\">Tu bebé decide qué comer, cuánto y a qué ritmo\\\\u003c/span>\\\\u003c/span>\\\\u003c/p>\\\\n\\\\u003cp dir=\\\\\\"ltr\\\\\\" class=\\\\\\"bf-wysiwyg-top bf-wysiwyg-hide-app\\\\\\">Ten en cuenta que el apetito de un bebé puede variar de un día para otro y depende de muchos factores.\\\\u003c/p>\\\\n\\\\u003cp dir=\\\\\\"ltr\\\\\\" class=\\\\\\"bf-wysiwyg-top bf-wysiwyg-hide-app\\\\\\">Hay días que se comen todo lo que hay en el plato, pero otros termina todo por el suelo. Un día come muy rápido y otro tarda una eternidad.\\\\u003c/p>\\\\n\\\\u003cp dir=\\\\\\"ltr\\\\\\" class=\\\\\\"bf-wysiwyg-top bf-wysiwyg-hide-app\\\\\\">\\\\u003cimg src=\\\\\\"https://buildfire.imgix.net/dcbca80b-3d23-11ea-91c9-06e43182e96c/6e6984f0-5291-11f0-8879-812a2ef26214.png?width=1440&amp;height=1440\\\\\\" alt=\\\\\\"\\\\\\" expr-src=\\\\\\"${buildfire.imageLib.resizeImage(\'https://s3-us-west-2.amazonaws.com/imageserver.prod/dcbca80b-3d23-11ea-91c9-06e43182e96c/6e6984f0-5291-11f0-8879-812a2ef26214.png\', { size: \'full_width\', aspect: \'1:1\' })}\\\\\\" class=\\\\\\"full_width\\\\\\" data-bf-image=\\\\\\"%7B%22resize%22%3Atrue%2C%22crop%22%3A%22%22%2C%22fixed%22%3A%22%22%2C%22responsive%22%3A%22full_width%22%2C%22originalSrc%22%3A%22https%3A//s3-us-west-2.amazonaws.com/imageserver.prod/dcbca80b-3d23-11ea-91c9-06e43182e96c/6e6984f0-5291-11f0-8879-812a2ef26214.png%22%7D\\\\\\">Cada bebé es único y tiene su propio ritmo de alimentación.\\\\u003cstrong> Confía en tu bebé\\\\u003c/strong>: manifestará signos de saciedad o te lo hará saber si sigue teniendo hambre.\\\\u003c/p>\\\\n\\\\u003cp dir=\\\\\\"ltr\\\\\\" class=\\\\\\"bf-wysiwyg-top bf-wysiwyg-hide-app\\\\\\">\\\\u003cimg src=\\\\\\"https://buildfire.imgix.net/dcbca80b-3d23-11ea-91c9-06e43182e96c/reparto-responsabilidades.png?width=1440&amp;height=1440\\\\\\" alt=\\\\\\"\\\\\\" expr-src=\\\\\\"${buildfire.imageLib.resizeImage(\'https://s3-us-west-2.amazonaws.com/imageserver.prod/dcbca80b-3d23-11ea-91c9-06e43182e96c/reparto-responsabilidades.png\', { size: \'full_width\', aspect: \'1:1\' })}\\\\\\" class=\\\\\\"full_width\\\\\\" data-bf-image=\\\\\\"%7B%22resize%22%3Atrue%2C%22crop%22%3A%22%22%2C%22fixed%22%3A%22%22%2C%22responsive%22%3A%22full_width%22%2C%22originalSrc%22%3A%22https%3A//s3-us-west-2.amazonaws.com/imageserver.prod/dcbca80b-3d23-11ea-91c9-06e43182e96c/reparto-responsabilidades.png%22%7D\\\\\\">Respira hondo y sé realista. A veces nos hacemos proyecciones equivocadas, creemos que el bebé&nbsp;va a dejar el plato limpio y se lo va a comer todo a toda velocidad. Es raro que eso pase, ¿vale?\\\\u003c/p>\\\\n\\\\u003cp class=\\\\\\"bf-wysiwyg-top bf-wysiwyg-hide-app\\\\\\">\\\\u003ca href=\\\\\\"#top\\\\\\">\\\\u003cimg src=\\\\\\"https://buildfire.imgix.net/dcbca80b-3d23-11ea-91c9-06e43182e96c/volver-arriba-grande.png?width=1080&amp;height=1080\\\\\\" alt=\\\\\\"\\\\\\" data-bf-image=\\\\\\"%7B%22resize%22%3Atrue%2C%22crop%22%3A%22%22%2C%22fixed%22%3A%22%22%2C%22responsive%22%3A%22full_width%22%2C%22originalSrc%22%3A%22https%3A//s3-us-west-2.amazonaws.com/imageserver.prod/dcbca80b-3d23-11ea-91c9-06e43182e96c/volver-arriba-grande.png%22%7D\\\\\\">\\\\u003c/a>\\\\u003c/p>\\\\n\\\\u003chr class=\\\\\\"bf-wysiwyg-top bf-wysiwyg-hide-app\\\\\\">\\\\n\\\\u003cp class=\\\\\\"bf-wysiwyg-top bf-wysiwyg-hide-app\\\\\\" dir=\\\\\\"ltr\\\\\\" style=\\\\\\"line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 9pt; margin-bottom: 9pt; text-align: left;\\\\\\">&nbsp;\\\\u003c/p>\\\\n\\\\u003cp id=\\\\\\"ventajas\\\\\\" class=\\\\\\"bf-wysiwyg-top bf-wysiwyg-hide-app\\\\\\" dir=\\\\\\"ltr\\\\\\" style=\\\\\\"line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 9pt; margin-bottom: 9pt;\\\\\\">\\\\u003cspan style=\\\\\\"color: #000000;\\\\\\">\\\\u003cstrong>\\\\u003cspan style=\\\\\\"font-size: 18px;\\\\\\">¿Cuáles son las ventajas del BLW?\\\\u003c/span>\\\\u003c/strong>\\\\u003c/span>\\\\u003c/p>\\\\n\\\\u003cp dir=\\\\\\"ltr\\\\\\" class=\\\\\\"bf-wysiwyg-top bf-wysiwyg-hide-app\\\\\\">Como podrás imaginar, iniciar con tu hijo el viaje del BLW tiene infinitos beneficios:\\\\u003c/p>\\\\n\\\\u003cp dir=\\\\\\"ltr\\\\\\" class=\\\\\\"bf-wysiwyg-top bf-wysiwyg-hide-app\\\\\\">•&nbsp;\\\\u003cstrong>Experimentar texturas, colores, olores y sabores variados.\\\\u003c/strong> Y de forma mucho más educativa que con algunos juguetes caros que se ven por ahí.\\\\u003c/p>\\\\n\\\\u003cp dir=\\\\\\"ltr\\\\\\" class=\\\\\\"bf-wysiwyg-top bf-wysiwyg-hide-app\\\\\\">•&nbsp;El bebé&nbsp;\\\\u003cstrong>seguirá&nbsp;haciendo lo que más le gusta\\\\u003c/strong> en la vida:&nbsp;¡explorar el mundo y jugar\u0021\\\\u003c/p>\\\\n\\\\u003cp dir=\\\\\\"ltr\\\\\\" class=\\\\\\"bf-wysiwyg-top bf-wysiwyg-hide-app\\\\\\">•&nbsp;Tendrá&nbsp;\\\\u003cstrong>menos probabilidades de ser un “niño de mal comer”&nbsp;\\\\u003c/strong>o un “adulto con paladar infantil” (una expresión que además perderá todo su sentido).\\\\u003c/p>\\\\n\\\\u003cp dir=\\\\\\"ltr\\\\\\" class=\\\\\\"bf-wysiwyg-top bf-wysiwyg-hide-app\\\\\\">• Ayuda en el proceso de adquisición del habla gracias al \\\\u003cstrong>incremento de las habilidades motoras orales\\\\u003c/strong>.&nbsp;\\\\u003c/p>\\\\n\\\\u003cp dir=\\\\\\"ltr\\\\\\" class=\\\\\\"bf-wysiwyg-top bf-wysiwyg-hide-app\\\\\\">•&nbsp;Aprender a \\\\u003cstrong>masticar y tragar de manera más eficaz\\\\u003c/strong>.\\\\u003c/p>\\\\n\\\\u003cp dir=\\\\\\"ltr\\\\\\" class=\\\\\\"bf-wysiwyg-top bf-wysiwyg-hide-app\\\\\\">•&nbsp;Desarrollar una&nbsp;\\\\u003cstrong>relación más positiva con la comida a lo largo de la vida\\\\u003c/strong>. Va a aprender a comer cuando tenga hambre y a parar de comer cuando no tenga.\\\\u003c/p>\\\\n\\\\u003cp dir=\\\\\\"ltr\\\\\\" class=\\\\\\"bf-wysiwyg-top bf-wysiwyg-hide-app\\\\\\">•&nbsp;\\\\u003cstrong>Tardarás menos&nbsp;en&nbsp;preparar la comida\\\\u003c/strong>, ya que estaréis comiendo prácticamente&nbsp;lo mismo, solo que adaptado con una preparación previa y un corte seguro.\\\\u003c/p>\\\\n\\\\u003cp dir=\\\\\\"ltr\\\\\\" class=\\\\\\"bf-wysiwyg-top bf-wysiwyg-hide-app\\\\\\">•&nbsp;\\\\u003cstrong>Es muy probable que toda la familia empiece a comer mejor\\\\u003c/strong> (¡tú también\u0021).&nbsp;\\\\u003c/p>\\\\n\\\\u003cp dir=\\\\\\"ltr\\\\\\" class=\\\\\\"bf-wysiwyg-top bf-wysiwyg-hide-app\\\\\\">•&nbsp;Vas a poder&nbsp;r\\\\u003cstrong>elajarte mientras comes&nbsp;\\\\u003c/strong>(en serio, ¡eso no tiene precio\u0021), ya que tu bebé estará concentrado en su brócoli y ocupado explorando y aprendiendo con la comida. ¡Tú solo&nbsp;tendrás que supervisar\u0021\\\\u003c/p>\\\\n\\\\u003cp class=\\\\\\"bf-wysiwyg-top bf-wysiwyg-hide-app\\\\\\" dir=\\\\\\"ltr\\\\\\">&nbsp;\\\\u003c/p>\\\\n\\\\u003cp class=\\\\\\"bf-wysiwyg-top bf-wysiwyg-hide-app\\\\\\" dir=\\\\\\"ltr\\\\\\" style=\\\\\\"line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 9pt; margin-bottom: 9pt; text-align: left;\\\\\\">\\\\u003cimg src=\\\\\\"https://buildfire.imgix.net/dcbca80b-3d23-11ea-91c9-06e43182e96c/9-min.png?width=1188&amp;height=1188\\\\\\" width=\\\\\\"\\\\\\">\\\\u003c/p>\\\\n\\\\u003cp class=\\\\\\"bf-wysiwyg-top bf-wysiwyg-hide-app\\\\\\" dir=\\\\\\"ltr\\\\\\" style=\\\\\\"line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 9pt; margin-bottom: 9pt; text-align: left;\\\\\\">&nbsp;\\\\u003c/p>\\\\n\\\\u003cp class=\\\\\\"bf-wysiwyg-top bf-wysiwyg-hide-app\\\\\\" dir=\\\\\\"ltr\\\\\\" style=\\\\\\"line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 9pt; margin-bottom: 9pt; text-align: left;\\\\\\">\\\\u003cspan style=\\\\\\"font-size: 18px;\\\\\\">\\\\u003cstrong>¿Cuáles son las desventajas del BLW?\\\\u003c/strong>\\\\u003c/span>\\\\u003c/p>\\\\n\\\\u003cp class=\\\\\\"bf-wysiwyg-top bf-wysiwyg-hide-app\\\\\\" dir=\\\\\\"ltr\\\\\\">Como todo en esta vida, el BLW tiene algunas desventajas.\\\\u003c/p>\\\\n\\\\u003cp class=\\\\\\"bf-wysiwyg-top bf-wysiwyg-hide-app\\\\\\" dir=\\\\\\"ltr\\\\\\">Aun así, creemos que&nbsp;\\\\u003cstrong>merece la pena hacer BLW\\\\u003c/strong>, pero te dejaremos que decidas tú. Estas son algunas de las desventajas:\\\\u003c/p>\\\\n\\\\u003cp class=\\\\\\"bf-wysiwyg-top bf-wysiwyg-hide-app\\\\\\" dir=\\\\\\"ltr\\\\\\">\\\\u003cspan style=\\\\\\"font-size: 16px;\\\\\\">\\\\u003cstrong>La suciedad\\\\u003cbr>\\\\u003c/strong>\\\\u003c/span>Al principio prácticamente todo acaba por todas partes, sobre todo en el suelo. Pero con el tiempo y con la práctica, todo mejora.\\\\u003c/p>\\\\n\\\\u003cp class=\\\\\\"bf-wysiwyg-top bf-wysiwyg-hide-app\\\\\\" dir=\\\\\\"ltr\\\\\\">¿Te agobia que todo quede hecho un desastre? No te preocupes. Tenemos una sección especial en la aplicación sobre este tema, con consejos y trucos para prevenir y saber \\\\u003cstrong>cómo lidiar con la suciedad\\\\u003c/strong>.\\\\u003c/p>\\\\n\\\\u003cp class=\\\\\\"bf-wysiwyg-top bf-wysiwyg-hide-app\\\\\\" dir=\\\\\\"ltr\\\\\\">\\\\u003ca data-action-item=\\\\\\"%7B%22action%22%3A%22linkToApp%22%2C%22instanceId%22%3A%2203dd5856-99ed-4950-ad40-6d95a29ef7f2-1562922849749%22%2C%22title%22%3A%22C%F3mo%20lidiar%20con%20la%20suciedad%22%2C%22iconUrl%22%3A%22https%3A//s3-us-west-2.amazonaws.com/imageserver.prod/dcbca80b-3d23-11ea-91c9-06e43182e96c/suciedad-home.jpg%22%2C%22iconClassName%22%3Anull%2C%22queryString%22%3Anull%2C%22deeplinkId%22%3Anull%7D\\\\\\">\\\\u003cimg src=\\\\\\"https://buildfire.imgix.net/dcbca80b-3d23-11ea-91c9-06e43182e96c/440e5c20-5292-11f0-ab2a-cf65c95ce151.png?width=1440&amp;height=1440\\\\\\" alt=\\\\\\"\\\\\\" expr-src=\\\\\\"${buildfire.imageLib.resizeImage(\'https://s3-us-west-2.amazonaws.com/imageserver.prod/dcbca80b-3d23-11ea-91c9-06e43182e96c/440e5c20-5292-11f0-ab2a-cf65c95ce151.png\', { size: \'full_width\', aspect: \'1:1\' })}\\\\\\" class=\\\\\\"full_width\\\\\\" data-bf-image=\\\\\\"%7B%22resize%22%3Atrue%2C%22crop%22%3A%22%22%2C%22fixed%22%3A%22%22%2C%22responsive%22%3A%22full_width%22%2C%22originalSrc%22%3A%22https%3A//s3-us-west-2.amazonaws.com/imageserver.prod/dcbca80b-3d23-11ea-91c9-06e43182e96c/440e5c20-5292-11f0-ab2a-cf65c95ce151.png%22%7D\\\\\\">\\\\u003cbr>\\\\u003cbr>\\\\u003c/a>\\\\u003cspan style=\\\\\\"font-size: 16px;\\\\\\">\\\\u003cstrong>El miedo\\\\u003cbr>\\\\u003c/strong>\\\\u003c/span>Puede que todo esto te genere ansiedad y que tengas miedo a que tu bebé se atragante. Como sabemos que es una sensación muy común, también tenemos una sección dedicada a esto:\\\\u003c/p>\\\\n\\\\u003cp class=\\\\\\"bf-wysiwyg-top bf-wysiwyg-hide-app\\\\\\" dir=\\\\\\"ltr\\\\\\">\\\\u003cimg src=\\\\\\"https://buildfire.imgix.net/dcbca80b-3d23-11ea-91c9-06e43182e96c/7fd984f0-5292-11f0-bab1-771a8c68699e.png?width=1440&amp;height=1440\\\\\\" alt=\\\\\\"\\\\\\" expr-src=\\\\\\"${buildfire.imageLib.resizeImage(\'https://s3-us-west-2.amazonaws.com/imageserver.prod/dcbca80b-3d23-11ea-91c9-06e43182e96c/7fd984f0-5292-11f0-bab1-771a8c68699e.png\', { size: \'full_width\', aspect: \'1:1\' })}\\\\\\" class=\\\\\\"full_width\\\\\\" data-bf-image=\\\\\\"%7B%22resize%22%3Atrue%2C%22crop%22%3A%22%22%2C%22fixed%22%3A%22%22%2C%22responsive%22%3A%22full_width%22%2C%22originalSrc%22%3A%22https%3A//s3-us-west-2.amazonaws.com/imageserver.prod/dcbca80b-3d23-11ea-91c9-06e43182e96c/7fd984f0-5292-11f0-bab1-771a8c68699e.png%22%7D\\\\\\" data-execute=\\\\\\"%7B%22action%22%3A%22linkToApp%22%2C%22instanceId%22%3A%2203dd5856-99ed-4950-ad40-6d95a29ef7f2-1562915962006%22%2C%22title%22%3A%22Arcada%20y%20atragantamiento%22%2C%22iconUrl%22%3A%22https%3A//s3-us-west-2.amazonaws.com/imageserver.prod/dcbca80b-3d23-11ea-91c9-06e43182e96c/no-se-va-asfixiar-home.jpg%22%2C%22iconClassName%22%3Anull%2C%22queryString%22%3Anull%2C%22deeplinkId%22%3Anull%7D\\\\\\">\\\\u003c/p>\\\\n\\\\u003cp class=\\\\\\"bf-wysiwyg-top bf-wysiwyg-hide-app\\\\\\" dir=\\\\\\"ltr\\\\\\">\\\\u003cimg src=\\\\\\"https://buildfire.imgix.net/dcbca80b-3d23-11ea-91c9-06e43182e96c/afce4880-5292-11f0-8879-812a2ef26214.png?width=1440&amp;height=1440\\\\\\" alt=\\\\\\"\\\\\\" expr-src=\\\\\\"${buildfire.imageLib.resizeImage(\'https://s3-us-west-2.amazonaws.com/imageserver.prod/dcbca80b-3d23-11ea-91c9-06e43182e96c/afce4880-5292-11f0-8879-812a2ef26214.png\', { size: \'full_width\', aspect: \'1:1\' })}\\\\\\" class=\\\\\\"full_width\\\\\\" data-bf-image=\\\\\\"%7B%22resize%22%3Atrue%2C%22crop%22%3A%22%22%2C%22fixed%22%3A%22%22%2C%22responsive%22%3A%22full_width%22%2C%22originalSrc%22%3A%22https%3A//s3-us-west-2.amazonaws.com/imageserver.prod/dcbca80b-3d23-11ea-91c9-06e43182e96c/afce4880-5292-11f0-8879-812a2ef26214.png%22%7D\\\\\\">Para tu tranquilidad, el atragantamiento es un suceso poco habitual. \\\\u003cstrong>La probabilidad de que ocurra con el uso del método BLW o con purés es exactamente la misma.\\\\u003c/strong>\\\\u003c/p>\\\\n\\\\u003cp class=\\\\\\"bf-wysiwyg-top bf-wysiwyg-hide-app\\\\\\" dir=\\\\\\"ltr\\\\\\">La realidad es que el alimento con el que más atragantamientos se producen es la leche, no los sólidos. Aun así, si te da más tranquilidad, también puedes empezar con triturados y hacer la transición a sólidos de forma gradual (y nunca más tarde de los 7-8 meses).\\\\u003c/p>\\\\n\\\\u003cp class=\\\\\\"bf-wysiwyg-top bf-wysiwyg-hide-app\\\\\\" dir=\\\\\\"ltr\\\\\\">\\\\u003cimg src=\\\\\\"https://buildfire.imgix.net/dcbca80b-3d23-11ea-91c9-06e43182e96c/e58c85e0-5292-11f0-8879-812a2ef26214.png?width=1440&amp;height=1440\\\\\\" alt=\\\\\\"\\\\\\" expr-src=\\\\\\"${buildfire.imageLib.resizeImage(\'https://s3-us-west-2.amazonaws.com/imageserver.prod/dcbca80b-3d23-11ea-91c9-06e43182e96c/e58c85e0-5292-11f0-8879-812a2ef26214.png\', { size: \'full_width\', aspect: \'1:1\' })}\\\\\\" class=\\\\\\"full_width\\\\\\" data-bf-image=\\\\\\"%7B%22resize%22%3Atrue%2C%22crop%22%3A%22%22%2C%22fixed%22%3A%22%22%2C%22responsive%22%3A%22full_width%22%2C%22originalSrc%22%3A%22https%3A//s3-us-west-2.amazonaws.com/imageserver.prod/dcbca80b-3d23-11ea-91c9-06e43182e96c/e58c85e0-5292-11f0-8879-812a2ef26214.png%22%7D\\\\\\" data-execute=\\\\\\"%7B%22action%22%3A%22linkToApp%22%2C%22instanceId%22%3A%2203dd5856-99ed-4950-ad40-6d95a29ef7f2-1582622496357%22%2C%22title%22%3A%22C%F3mo%20empezar%20con%20triturados%22%2C%22iconUrl%22%3A%22https%3A//s3-us-west-2.amazonaws.com/imageserver.prod/dcbca80b-3d23-11ea-91c9-06e43182e96c/no-quieres-blw-home.jpg%22%2C%22iconClassName%22%3Anull%2C%22queryString%22%3Anull%2C%22deeplinkId%22%3Anull%7D\\\\\\">&nbsp;\\\\u003c/p>\\\\n\\\\u003cp class=\\\\\\"bf-wysiwyg-top bf-wysiwyg-hide-app\\\\\\" dir=\\\\\\"ltr\\\\\\">\\\\u003cspan style=\\\\\\"font-size: 16px;\\\\\\">\\\\u003cstrong>Convencer a los demás\\\\u003c/strong>&nbsp;\\\\u003cbr>\\\\u003c/span>Seguramente tengas&nbsp;que convencer a las personas cercanas de que el BLW es una buena opción.\\\\u003c/p>\\\\n\\\\u003cp class=\\\\\\"bf-wysiwyg-top bf-wysiwyg-hide-app\\\\\\">Lo más probable es que tus padres no hayan usado este método contigo, ya que en las últimas décadas ha habido varias generaciones de biberones y papillas, por eso podemos encontrarnos con mucha incredulidad y críticas.\\\\u003c/p>\\\\n\\\\u003cp class=\\\\\\"bf-wysiwyg-top bf-wysiwyg-hide-app\\\\\\">A veces nos vemos en la tesitura de tener que convencer a nuestros padres, nuestra pareja, la cuidadora e incluso a algunos pediatras desactualizados de que no pasa nada por dar sólidos desde el inicio si se hace de forma segura.&nbsp;\\\\u003c/p>\\\\n\\\\u003cp class=\\\\\\"bf-wysiwyg-top bf-wysiwyg-hide-app\\\\\\">Tener una red de apoyo es muy importante, por eso tenemos una sección para ayudarte a \\\\u003cstrong>concienciar a las personas de tu entorno\\\\u003c/strong>.\\\\u003c/p>\\\\n\\\\u003cp class=\\\\\\"bf-wysiwyg-top bf-wysiwyg-hide-app\\\\\\">\\\\u003cimg src=\\\\\\"https://buildfire.imgix.net/dcbca80b-3d23-11ea-91c9-06e43182e96c/7f7d65c0-5293-11f0-ab2a-cf65c95ce151.png?width=1440&amp;height=1440\\\\\\" alt=\\\\\\"\\\\\\" expr-src=\\\\\\"${buildfire.imageLib.resizeImage(\'https://s3-us-west-2.amazonaws.com/imageserver.prod/dcbca80b-3d23-11ea-91c9-06e43182e96c/7f7d65c0-5293-11f0-ab2a-cf65c95ce151.png\', { size: \'full_width\', aspect: \'1:1\' })}\\\\\\" class=\\\\\\"full_width\\\\\\" data-bf-image=\\\\\\"%7B%22resize%22%3Atrue%2C%22crop%22%3A%22%22%2C%22fixed%22%3A%22%22%2C%22responsive%22%3A%22full_width%22%2C%22originalSrc%22%3A%22https%3A//s3-us-west-2.amazonaws.com/imageserver.prod/dcbca80b-3d23-11ea-91c9-06e43182e96c/7f7d65c0-5293-11f0-ab2a-cf65c95ce151.png%22%7D\\\\\\" data-execute=\\\\\\"%7B%22action%22%3A