.imageLib.resizeImage(\'https://s3-us-west-2.amazonaws.com/imageserver.prod/4d40c70e-38bc-11ed-b686-12565309935d/gui%CC%81a%20es%20-%20elia.png\', { size: \'full_width\', aspect: \'1:1\' })}\\\\\\" class=\\\\\\"full_width\\\\\\" data-bf-image=\\\\\\"%7B%22resize%22%3Atrue%2C%22crop%22%3A%22%22%2C%22fixed%22%3A%22%22%2C%22responsive%22%3A%22full_width%22%2C%22originalSrc%22%3A%22https%3A//s3-us-west-2.amazonaws.com/imageserver.prod/4d40c70e-38bc-11ed-b686-12565309935d/gui%25CC%2581a%2520es%2520-%2520elia.png%22%7D\\\\\\">\\\\u003c/span>\\\\u003cspan style=\\\\\\"font-size: 12px;\\\\\\">\\\\u003cimg src=\\\\\\"https://buildfire.imgix.net/4d40c70e-38bc-11ed-b686-12565309935d/gui%CC%81a%20es%20-%20tereza.png?width=1440&amp;height=1440\\\\\\" alt=\\\\\\"\\\\\\" expr-src=\\\\\\"${buildfire.imageLib.resizeImage(\'https://s3-us-west-2.amazonaws.com/imageserver.prod/4d40c70e-38bc-11ed-b686-12565309935d/gui%CC%81a%20es%20-%20tereza.png\', { size: \'full_width\', aspect: \'1:1\' })}\\\\\\" class=\\\\\\"full_width\\\\\\" data-bf-image=\\\\\\"%7B%22resize%22%3Atrue%2C%22crop%22%3A%22%22%2C%22fixed%22%3A%22%22%2C%22responsive%22%3A%22full_width%22%2C%22originalSrc%22%3A%22https%3A//s3-us-west-2.amazonaws.com/imageserver.prod/4d40c70e-38bc-11ed-b686-12565309935d/gui%25CC%2581a%2520es%2520-%2520tereza.png%22%7D\\\\\\">\\\\u003c/span>\\\\u003cbr>\\\\u003cspan style=\\\\\\"font-size: 16px;\\\\\\">Referencias\\\\u003c/span>\\\\u003c/strong>\\\\u003c/span>\\\\u003c/p>\\\\n\\\\u003cp class=\\\\\\"bf-wysiwyg-top bf-wysiwyg-hide-app\\\\\\">\\\\u003cspan style=\\\\\\"font-size: 12px;\\\\\\">1. Klag, E.A., McNamara, K., Geraghty, S.R, \\\\u003cem>et al.\\\\u003c/em> (2016). \\\\u003ca href=\\\\\\"https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/pmc/articles/PMC4774553/\\\\\\">Associations between breast milk feeding, introduction of solid foods, and weight gain in the first 12 months of life\\\\u003c/a>. Clinical Pediatrics 54(11) 1059-1067.\\\\u003c/span>\\\\u003c/p>\\\\n\\\\u003cp class=\\\\\\"bf-wysiwyg-top bf-wysiwyg-hide-app\\\\\\">\\\\u003cspan style=\\\\\\"font-size: 12px;\\\\\\">2. Organización Mundial de la Salud. “\\\\u003ca href=\\\\\\"https://www.who.int/es/health-topics/breastfeeding#tab=tab_1\\\\\\">Lactancia materna\\\\u003c/a>”\\\\u003c/span>\\\\u003c/p>\\\\n\\\\u003cp class=\\\\\\"bf-wysiwyg-top bf-wysiwyg-hide-app\\\\\\">\\\\u003cspan style=\\\\\\"font-size: 12px;\\\\\\">3. AEP - Asociación Española de Pediatría (Comité de Nutrición y Lactancia Materna).&nbsp;“\\\\u003ca href=\\\\\\"https://www.aeped.es/comite-nutricion-y-lactancia-materna/lactancia-materna/documentos/protocolo-alimentacion-con-leche-materna-en\\\\\\">Protocolo para la alimentación con leche materna en las escuelas infantiles\\\\u003c/a>”\\\\u003c/span>\\\\u003c/p>\\\\n\\\\u003cp class=\\\\\\"bf-wysiwyg-top bf-wysiwyg-hide-app\\\\\\">\\\\u003cspan style=\\\\\\"font-size: 12px;\\\\\\">4. AEP - \\\\\\"\\\\u003ca href=\\\\\\"https://www.aeped.es/comite-nutricion-y-lactancia-materna/lactancia-materna/documentos/recomendaciones-sobre-lactancia-materna\\\\\\">Recomendaciones sobre lactancia materna del Comité de Lactancia Materna de la Asociación Española de Pediatría\\\\u003c/a>\\\\\\"\\\\u003c/span>\\\\u003c/p>\\\\n\\\\u003cp class=\\\\\\"bf-wysiwyg-top bf-wysiwyg-hide-app\\\\\\">\\\\u003cspan style=\\\\\\"font-size: 12px;\\\\\\">5. Alba Lactancia. “\\\\u003ca href=\\\\\\"http://albalactanciamaterna.org/lactancia/tema-4-cuando-los-ninos-crecen/lactancia-y-reincorporacion-al-trabajo-remunerado/\\\\\\">Lactancia materna y reincorporación al trabajo remunerado\\\\u003c/a>”\\\\u003c/span>\\\\u003c/p>\\\\n\\\\u003cp class=\\\\\\"bf-wysiwyg-top bf-wysiwyg-hide-app\\\\\\">\\\\u003cspan style=\\\\\\"font-size: 12px;\\\\\\">6. LactApp. “\\\\u003ca href=\\\\\\"https://blog.lactapp.es/recopilatorio-especial-vuelta-al-trabajo/\\\\\\">Lactancia y vuelta al trabajo: especial recopilatorio\\\\u003c/a>”\\\\u003c/span>\\\\u003c/p>\\\\n\\\\u003cp class=\\\\\\"bf-wysiwyg-top bf-wysiwyg-hide-app\\\\\\">\\\\u00